Answer: Clotrimazole pessary 500 mg per vagina: induction once a night for 10–14 nights according to response, then maintenance once a week.

Treatment of VVC in pregnancy is topical: Acute VVC — clotrimazole pessary 500 mg per vagina once a night for up to 7 consecutive nights. Recurrent VVC — induction with clotrimazole pessary 500 mg per vagina once a night for 10–14 nights according to response, then maintenance clotrimazole pessary 500 mg per vagina once a week. (Oral fluconazole regimens used in non-pregnant recurrent VVC are avoided in pregnancy.)$mmqz$,990,now()) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content,type=EXCLUDED.type;

